Trigger TDD DLandUL Scell Addition Of Cell-2 With Rsrp Via A1 Event
    [Arguments]    ${ue_id}=1
    Start rrc log    A1_based_scell_add_UE${ue_id}
    ${ret1}=    Execute Egate Command    ue_measurement_send_nr id=${ue_id} meas_id=1 event=A1 srsrp_nr=120 ssinr_nr=59 srsrq_nr=32
    ...    pass_regexp=SCellIndex 1 activated successfully
    Should Contain    ${ret1}    physCellId ${cell2_PHY_TDD}
    Get rrc log

Trigger TDD DLandUL Scell Release Of Cell-2 With Rsrp Via A2 Event
    [Arguments]    ${ue_id}=1
    Start rrc log    A2_based_scell_rel_UE${ue_id}
    Execute Egate Command    ue_measurement_send_nr id=${ue_id} meas_id=2 event=A2 scell=1 scell_rsrp=32 scell_rsrq=0
    ...    pass_regexp=sCellToReleaseList
    Get rrc log

Ue Register And Pdu Session Setup At FDD Cell-1
